{
 "lines": {
  "Bad day switch. Having a hard day? Turn this on and Highkeep shows only the basics, with bigger buttons.": "1b241909b3cf",
  "Good morning. Let's get you ready. Step one: find your keys. They're usually by the front door.": "e52d6920f339",
  "Moving around. Use these to go to Practice, Games, your Palace, and More. Home always brings you back here.": "5749ee2f02a9",
  "Quick helpers. Done-check remembers what you did. Where is it? remembers where things are. Who's that? remembers people.": "79dc257a9721",
  "Read aloud is on. I will read each step to you.": "08321edb4ed1",
  "Reminder. Call the dentist at 2 PM.": "7f02434aa89e",
  "This is Maria. She lives next door and has a dog named Pepper.": "99322599acae",
  "Today's list. Tap each thing as you pack it. A gold check means it's done.": "83f2c19d5e38",
  "Where am I?. Lost? Tap here any time and I'll read out where you are and what to do next.": "7325bd580c94",
  "You are on Card Flip. Step 1 of 3. Read how to play, then tap Start.": "00fcdb0f6203",
  "You are on Card Flip. Step 2 of 3. Now tap one more card to look for its match.": "6f19d7d9b8f2",
  "You are on Card Flip. Step 2 of 3. Tap any card to turn it over.": "bd6121f88f5b",
  "You are on Card Flip. Step 3 of 3. Great work. Tap Play again, or go back to Games.": "5bf8073af96f",
  "You are on Done-check. Tap a button right after you do it. I'll remember the time for you.": "e963da7c95a1",
  "You are on Games. Tap a doorway to pick a game. Card Flip is ready to play.": "51db0872b59c",
  "You are on Home. All set! You can check things off, or tap a button below.": "c608ac12bde9",
  "You are on Home. Bad day mode is on. Just your list and the basics. Tap each thing as you pack it.": "deb07974503a",
  "You are on Home. Tap each thing on your list as you pack it.": "ac18063de5f6",
  "You are on How should I help?. Step 3 of 7. Choose what feels comfortable. You can change these later in More.": "3471311e36f5",
  "You are on More. Change how Highkeep helps you. Your choices are saved right away.": "afaf725664a4",
  "You are on Pick your world. Step 4 of 7. Tap a world. It shows in the window above. Then tap Next.": "36c62b4014bd",
  "You are on Practice. These short drills are coming soon. For now, tap Play Card Flip to practice.": "a322ed41fa16",
  "You are on Save a spot. Step 1 of 3. What did you put away? Type it or tap one, then tap Next.": "80657f5da369",
  "You are on Save a spot. Step 2 of 3. Where did you put the thing? Type it or tap one, then tap Next.": "e4da46522c46",
  "You are on Save a spot. Step 3 of 3. Add a photo if you like. It is optional. Then tap Save.": "ab1171d56cb4",
  "You are on Welcome. Step 1 of 7. This is the first step. Tap Next when you are ready.": "130e55b4d090",
  "You are on When do you leave?. Step 6 of 7. Pick the time you usually head out. Your checklist will pop up then.": "28ae772ca1e9",
  "You are on Where is it?. Search for a thing, or tap Save a spot when you put something away.": "33f5366dfd2e",
  "You are on Who is this for?. Step 2 of 7. Tap the one that fits, then tap Next.": "1ed0989706c8",
  "You are on Who's that?. Tap a person to hear their name. Adding people is coming soon.": "34c48d1c0ca1",
  "You are on You're ready. Step 7 of 7. Tap Show me around for a quick tour of Home, or skip it.": "ba49936ca0db",
  "You are on Your first checklist. Step 5 of 7. Keep the things you need. Tap the X to remove one, or add your own.": "21d3bc5b6144",
  "Your keep is complete! A new painting for your gallery hall.": "a0a7caeaf880",
  "Your keep. This is your keep. It fills with golden light as you check things off and play. Tap it to see your palace.": "5924e75a3e47",
  "You are on Games. Tap a doorway to pick a game. Card Flip and What Changed? are ready to play.": "827935487a03",
  "You are on What Changed?. Step 1 of 3. Read how to play, then tap Start.": "b4182d011d46",
  "You are on What Changed?. Step 2 of 3. Remember where each thing is. Tap I am ready when you can.": "998ee987edbb",
  "You are on What Changed?. Step 3 of 3. Great work. Tap Play again, or go back to Games.": "3e3cbe0fd514",
  "Well spotted! Something swapped.": "f1fe29de0c9b",
  "Good try. Something swapped. It is glowing now.": "5ad24d3385ef",
  "Well spotted! Something went missing.": "686e2fd9073f",
  "Good try. Something went missing. It is glowing now.": "90894d5433c7",
  "Well spotted! Something moved.": "e8af69776813",
  "Good try. Something moved. It is glowing now.": "d7632e0c3977",
  "Rosa walked to the market on a sunny morning. She bought a basket of red apples. A kind baker gave her a warm roll. Then Rosa carried everything home.": "070fd6d014b8",
  "Rosa walked to the market on a sunny morning. She bought a basket of red apples.": "eefc464e0555",
  "What did Rosa buy?": "c521b3931a74",
  "Where did Rosa go?": "cb68533727ee",
  "Sam went out to the garden after breakfast. He watered the yellow sunflowers with a green can. A little bee buzzed around his hat. Sam smiled and sat down in the shade.": "27e76c6f02c3",
  "Sam went out to the garden after breakfast. He watered the yellow sunflowers.": "14b289d5452e",
  "What did Sam water?": "ce1edd89f930",
  "Where did Sam go?": "10ebe747ed17",
  "Old Henry kept a white lighthouse by the sea. Every evening he climbed the stairs to light the big lamp. Boats far away could see the light and sail home safely. Then he drank a cup of tea and watched the stars.": "820228ea7913",
  "Old Henry kept a white lighthouse by the sea. Every evening he climbed the stairs to light the big lamp.": "6f1cfbc9d66b",
  "What did Henry do every evening?": "055cd36d5f7f",
  "Where was the lighthouse?": "3af7b3efcce1",
  "Grandma Ruth put on her blue apron in the kitchen. She mixed flour, eggs and sugar in a big bowl. Soon the whole house smelled of warm cinnamon cake. She shared a slice with her neighbor.": "7f66e0503058",
  "Grandma Ruth put on her blue apron in the kitchen. She baked a warm cinnamon cake.": "45ecfb0f8588",
  "What did Ruth bake?": "4fee6078433b",
  "Where did Ruth bake?": "57f2f20c8bbb",
  "Leo walked to the library on a rainy afternoon. He picked a big book about birds. Then he found a cozy chair by the window. He read until the rain stopped.": "c9c0141f549e",
  "Leo walked to the library on a rainy afternoon. He picked a big book about birds.": "55235dece9d2",
  "What kind of book did Leo pick?": "9c084a9def4a",
  "Where did Leo go?": "97a6a42633a3",
  "Maya went for a walk by the lake at sunset. Two white ducks swam close to the shore. She sat on a wooden bench and listened to the water. The sky turned orange and pink.": "0966f283e5ae",
  "Maya went for a walk by the lake at sunset. Two white ducks swam close to the shore.": "4dfad5c2e634",
  "What did Maya see on the water?": "aabd6aee9e75",
  "Where did Maya walk?": "c18da6ee4fa0",
  "Ben and his sister packed a picnic and went to the park. They spread a red blanket under a tall oak tree. They ate sandwiches and sipped cold lemonade. A friendly dog came to say hello.": "f6b44266b19a",
  "Ben and his sister had a picnic in the park. They sipped cold lemonade under a tall oak tree.": "920acd38289f",
  "What did they drink?": "1595d1ef5504",
  "Where did they have a picnic?": "3c5ed62d8d3a",
  "Nora stayed home on a rainy day. She made a pot of peppermint tea. Her gray cat curled up on her lap. They watched the raindrops on the window.": "951e4e6e9c67",
  "Nora stayed home on a rainy day. She made a pot of peppermint tea.": "dd0aee2f5e60",
  "What did Nora make?": "6e04409fdcb3",
  "Where did Nora stay?": "52d845a8faf2",
  "Who was the story about?": "ff62afbdb72b",
  "Yes, that's right!": "af66b534aaf6",
  "Not quite. Listen once more.": "9195f93d6af6",
  "Good try. Here is the story again.": "f9d80a606276",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 1 of 3. Read how to play, then tap Start.": "b3f16a5fcfe1",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 2 of 3. Tap the answer you remember.": "e989901ede41",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 2 of 3. Not quite. Listen once more, then try again.": "d5c72f954ef1",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 2 of 3. Well done. Tap Next when you are ready.": "b95aa2fe54a1",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 2 of 3. Good try. The answer is glowing. Tap Next when you are ready.": "043f9947d38c",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 3 of 3. Great work. Tap Play again, or go back to Games.": "728f09395c46",
  "You are on Games. Tap a doorway to pick a game. Card Flip, What Changed? and Story Recall are ready to play.": "b31a7e2b5e9b",
  "You are on Story Recall. Step 2 of 3. Listen to the story, then tap Questions.": "245225c8f29c"
 },
